  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Support ItemTemplate selectors for CollectionView.\n- Allow binding to a specific object instead of view's context.\n- Refine container API: Panel exposes Children, Border exposes Child, and ContentView, ScrollView, and ItemView expose Content.\n- Allow style, size, padding and indicator customization for Picker.\n- Remove SelectsFromMenu and IconSize from Button.\n- Let ItemView own its normal and highlighted backgrounds.\n- Auto size ItemView height using MinHeight.\n- Make ImageSource sealed record instead of struct.\n- Fix alpha not working for system colors.\n- Fix navigation always using tab stack instead of inside modals.\n- Fix Pressed action subscription suppressing TapCommand.",
